<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak ind output unchanged, yr/yr, in November.</title>
<headline>Slovak ind output unchanged, yr/yr, in November.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial output was unchanged, year-on-year, in November, after a 3.6 percent year-on-year increase in October, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    Nov 96     Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		+0.0	 +3.6    +10.1</p>
<p>Construction Output</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		+6.4	 +4.4     +1.6</p>
<p>Note. All figures are subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
